Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is it?\N-Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, am I dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the contrary, Remedios.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,ONE HUNDRED YEARS OF SOLITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a fatiguing effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but by the date of the ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.79,0:02:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios had become\Nas adept in the ways of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,as the rest of her sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,who wore the same boots\Nhe would wear a few years later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,as he stood in front of the firing squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,had a lump in his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more handsome than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Rebeca?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Per Úrsula's instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca was to get married on the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Rebeca,\Nsomeone's here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the night before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro Crespi had received a letter with\Nthe news of the imminent death of Giulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And he immediately left for the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single of Pietro's letters\Ncould do justice to your beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Giulia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Pietro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see him before the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not\Nyour actual wedding gown, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One should not\Nsubjugate life everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Life…\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not today, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not today. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding is the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So that their union will be blessed\Nfrom this day forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The love of God\Nshines upon the two of you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,unwavering, just as love should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, take the ring\Nand repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Aure--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh my goodness.\N-Wow. Did he drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll hit one. It's rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That day… would reveal\Nthe natural grace and composure
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that Remedios would forever show\Nin the face of adversity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Aureliano Buendía, take thee…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Aureliano Buendía, take thee…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,…Remedios Moscote, to be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,…Remedios Moscote, to be my wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,…to have and to hold…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,…to have and to hold…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…until death do us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,…until death do us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Remedios Moscote, take thee,\NAureliano Buendía, to be my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to have and to hold, for better or worse,\Nin sickness and in health,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,until death do us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let this union be an example.\N-Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A reminder to always adhere to\Nthe right way of doing things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,just like what Mr. Apolinar Moscote\Nhas brought to Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I now pronounce you husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-They've outdone themselves.\N-Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And over here are\Nthe Márquezes and the Visbals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you are some of the founders?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm-hmm.\N-Indeed. Gerineldo Márquez.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Father Nicanor Reyna\Nhas done us the honor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of rescheduling his spiritual activities\Nin Santa Marta to be able to come join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mrs. Leonor, you're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The honor is entirely mine. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-How are you?\N-Pleasure, Father. Isabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah!\N-I hope Macondo has been to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you bet it has.\NAnd now with God's presence,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Walk with me.\N-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, but we're at a wedding,\Nmy dear. Just be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine\Neverything that you've had to do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to support your family\Non your own, Mrs. Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully,\NI'm no stranger to work, Father Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll pray\Nfor the both of you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear, don't worry.\NI know my Pietro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll marry you as soon as he returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your marriage will be a wonderful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll make a beautiful bride.\NYou are going to make a beautiful couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you\Nwho sent that letter, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca… enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've done\Nmuch worse than that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have simply killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Would you like to dance, Amaranta?\N-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'd love to.\N-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get married today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Nicanor is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the dress.\NEverything's set up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be together\Nfor the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not die when we must,\Nbut when we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not die when we must,\Nbut when we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not die when we must…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not die when we must…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,…but when we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,…but when we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios took upon herself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the costly chore\Nof tending to José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She would keep his hair and beard free\Nof lice and nits. And most remarkably…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.71,0:11:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,…over the course of a few months…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,…she succeeded in communicating with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Metus? Miedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm afraid of care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, ants,\Nno one will see you if you come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. If you take that path…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Her arrival brought\Na breath of joy to the Buendías.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios, come here.\NI'll teach you how to make our candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ De amor, eres mi bien ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Tienes la gracia, canta, pajarito… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear,\Nwhat a lovely voice you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Her vitality overflowed\Nthe walls of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Senorita Rebeca Buendía,\Nmay I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.\NOne, two, three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And she spun like a whirlwind\Nof good health through the corridors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.13,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Remedios.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Visitación.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mrs. Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Aureliano,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he had found in her presence
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the motivation he needed\Nto keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.08,0:14:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd like a little coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And she was…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,…the last person Arcadio thought\Nabout before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios, stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because I didn't want\Nto ruin your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is a problem, Aureliano…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I already have two sons,\Nand he deserves a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you shouldn't have come here\Nunannounced like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.\NIt's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm sorry, and I promise to explain--\N-Aureliano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you, Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was before… I asked for\NRemedios's hand in marriage--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll make her raise a bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This child will always be a Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You better listen to me closely,\NÚrsula Iguarán.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never permit you to treat my son\Nthe same way that you treated Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see what your in-laws have to say\Nwhen they find out that you have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:17:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have a name already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have mine and my brother's names.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano José.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll convince Nicanor\Nto baptize the boy tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he has God's blessing\Nand we keep it secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we have a problem.\NDo you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to\Nthe Kingdom of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold him tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long will you be staying, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pietro and I would love to organize\Nour wedding while you are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no need to rush things, darling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,because Father Nicanor\Nhas decided to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible what you have achieved\Nin the middle of nowhere, Mrs. Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What surprises me the most, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,is that in the 30 years\Nsince you founded this town
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,no one has ever thought of\Nadding a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we've never needed a church\Nto bargain with God, Father Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but see, you cannot bargain\Nwith God, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Scriptures make that very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Buendía, has it ever occurred to you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that perhaps that horrific plague\Nthat struck years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,was God's way\Nof punishing you for being sinful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, does Úrsula have to answer\Nfor the people of Macondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Of course not.\NOf course she doesn't have to. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just last night,\NI was dreaming about the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm!\N-Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the biggest one in Colombia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,with windows from floor to ceiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,human-sized saints,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and an organ…\Nan organ just like Notre Dame has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already made\Na contribution, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.\N-We're hopeful that other people join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,With the grace of God\Nand the help of our good town,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we could be opening\Nour church doors in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca would be so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have the honor of inaugurating\Nthe church with your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be an honor\Nto get married at your church,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.63,0:20:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't believe\Nwe must wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But you would have a union\Nthat is blessed by God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Isn't Remedios's marriage blessed?\N-Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to wait three years?\NThe two of them got married at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because everybody in this family\Nturned conservative overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-That you all turned conservative over--\N-Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:21:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire town has been built\Ncollectively, Father Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure that the church\Nwill be ready much sooner
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,than any of you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there will be plenty of time\Nto plan the ceremony you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a cultured man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. No one ever taught you to knock, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let yourself in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We Moscotes are curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the government\Nto give us the resources
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:21:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to build a school in Macondo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I still haven't found\Na teacher that wants to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and who'd be willing\Nto take care of the facilities full-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:22:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry but I'm not interested in\Nworking under or answering to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have too many things on my plate to be\Nsticking my nose in your business, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.67,0:22:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting for an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.71,0:23:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Arcadio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an extra room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.79,0:23:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've left a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Excuse me.\N-Don't make things difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-I don't understand--\N-Anybody can claim to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.\NI don't know what kind of papers you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Papers that show--\N-Not giving you anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.88,0:24:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In this entire region,\Nno one has ever demanded
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I show a permit from the government\Nthat allows me to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. Unless you can\Ncome back with the civil code
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.79,0:24:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and can point out an actual law
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.17,0:24:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that proves to me I must show you\Nanything other than my medical diplomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.33,0:24:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.67,0:24:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scaring away potential customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.67,0:24:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's stood up to those guys\Nin a long time, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because you all need\Nsomeone to remind you of your rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Alirio Noguera. Homeopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.38,0:24:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Pleasure.\N-Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.08,0:24:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I run the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.58,0:25:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big responsibility\Nto deal with those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever want to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or need some medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.92,0:25:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,PUBLIC SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the school freed Arcadio from the weight\Nof that old familiar bitterness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.96,0:25:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Alchemy…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alchemy has always obsessed\Nsome of the biggest geniuses in history,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.83,0:26:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,for all of these individuals set out\Nto find the famous philosopher's stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The… the philosopher's stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.33,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by your faces,\Nyou probably have no clue what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is,\NGónzalez doesn't know a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.13,0:26:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.13,0:26:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come to the front\Nand teach the class yourself, Rojas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.13,0:26:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying on course is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.33,0:26:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm?\N-Enough, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.67,0:26:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna talk,\Nat least say something useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.42,0:26:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.96,0:27:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.58,0:27:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.25,0:27:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Aureliano,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been married for months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.25,0:27:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we giving Aureliano José a sibling?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.71,0:27:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you two knit a white one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.92,0:27:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we don't know the sex yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.58,0:28:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would love for the baby's aunts\Nto make their first gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.42,0:28:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The love\Nthat Aureliano and Remedios inspired
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,in both their families was so deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.54,0:28:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,that the moment she announced\Nshe was expecting a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.79,0:28:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even Rebeca and Amaranta declared a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But you made a promise, sir!\NWe're talking about the house of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.00,0:28:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, sir, maybe if the Lord\Nhad paid us what he owes us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be finished by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to collect\Nthe tithe if I can't open the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-The money will come from the tithe.\N-From the what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.38,0:28:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're gonna pay us with the tithe?\N-With the tithe. Yes of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.63,0:28:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, sir. Don't worry…\N-How long have they been at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One month.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they ran out of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-God can punish without a rod or a whip.\N-Let's fit the tiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want\Nthings falling on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.50,0:28:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.63,0:28:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And where would we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.63,0:29:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I have is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-What happened?\N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all good, Mrs. Úrsula.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.58,0:31:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Kyrie eleison… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.46,0:31:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not having collected enough\Nto even pay for the doors…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.33,0:31:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Kyrie… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.25,0:31:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,…Nicanor went through the town\Nwith a little bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.00,0:31:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,summoning people to an open-air mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Kyrie… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.29,0:31:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Many went out of curiosity.\NSome did so out of nostalgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.63,0:31:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Kyrie… ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.54,0:32:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Others went because they did not want\NGod to take their disdain
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.54,0:32:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,for his intermediary as a personal insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will all witness the Lord's
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.38,0:32:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,irrefutable and extraordinary\Nproof of power and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.21,0:32:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy who had been\Nhelping him handed him a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.33,0:32:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was full of thick chocolate,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.96,0:32:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,which he drank without taking\Na pause to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.42,0:32:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.04,0:32:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's magic.\N-I can't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.67,0:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No one doubted\Nthe divine nature of the demonstration…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,except for José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.04,0:33:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.79,0:33:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He discovered the fourth state of matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.75,0:33:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.38,0:33:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hmm.\N-This proves God's existence beyond doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.38,0:33:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot fool me
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,with your magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.58,0:33:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I see God in a daguerreotype,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.13,0:33:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't believe in your artifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.63,0:33:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.79,0:33:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.63,0:34:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he's always wanted\Nto see God in a daguerreotype.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.17,0:34:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, they discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.63,0:34:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that the devilish jargon\NJosé Arcadio had been speaking was Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.96,0:34:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mrs. Buendía,\Nmight I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go lay down?\NYour body needs rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.21,0:34:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to share something with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may have noticed,\NI've done everything in my power
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.58,0:34:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring faith into the homes of Macondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.79,0:34:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.67,0:34:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But at this pace,\Nwith the donations we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.92,0:34:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't finish this church in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.63,0:34:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At best, I'll finish it in ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to ask you\Nif you could, perhaps, help me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.75,0:34:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,by speaking to your fellow neighbors--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best if we don't burden Úrsula\Nwith that responsibility, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.29,0:34:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,God knows things happen\Nwhen they need to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.58,0:34:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ah, amen.\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Amen.\N-Either way, what's the rush? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.42,0:35:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll see you later.\N-See you later, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.21,0:35:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're driving my kids crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.71,0:35:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they want me to\Nbuy them some chemistry books.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.79,0:35:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.42,0:35:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Congratulations on your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.46,0:35:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.\N-Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.63,0:35:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Without knowing\Nthe secret of his parentage,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.08,0:35:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilar Ternera became just as irresistible\Nof an obsession for him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.67,0:35:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,as she'd been for his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.71,0:35:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He would look for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.21,0:35:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and would find her by the trail\Nof her smell of smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.46,0:35:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,not knowing exactly how to approach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.13,0:36:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.21,0:36:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.75,0:36:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.63,0:36:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Matilde!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.67,0:36:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we not friends anymore or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.75,0:36:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's what I've been wondering.\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.71,0:36:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you haven't\Ncome to the house in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I barely have time\Nafter the incident with José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.83,0:36:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm. I can imagine.\N-Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.46,0:36:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We all miss him a lot, that's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.63,0:36:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.13,0:36:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the other day,\Nhe was speaking to Father Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.67,0:36:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.83,0:36:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have\Nany idea what he's been saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.79,0:36:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he spends all day just chatting away,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.17,0:36:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,like he used to with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.17,0:37:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fine man, that Nicanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What, exactly,\Nare you trying to say, Úrsula?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.54,0:37:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel like\Nyour closeness to the Moscotes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.00,0:37:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,has made you forget about\Nthe town we founded with José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.96,0:37:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,\NJosé Arcadio is tied up to a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.92,0:37:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have to look after my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.96,0:37:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My memory's unimpaired, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.04,0:37:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I know the two of you left
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.58,0:37:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,right in the middle of\Nmy son Aureliano's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also know that the Moscotes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.46,0:37:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,are the only ones\Nwho have been to the house
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.21,0:37:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,since José Arcadio abandoned us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.46,0:37:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.17,0:37:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.67,0:37:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never understood…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.38,0:38:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the point of competition\Nbetween two adversaries
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.92,0:38:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,who share the same principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.79,0:38:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.71,0:38:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.13,0:38:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,tie you to a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.04,0:38:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm crazy, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Concerned about his own faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the priest never came to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.17,0:38:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one spoonful at least, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't starve\Nthat child inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.54,0:39:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.71,0:39:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.21,0:40:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With or without stained glass,\Nwith or without bells,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.71,0:40:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebeca needs to be standing\Nat the altar at the end of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.67,0:40:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we clear, Nicanor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.58,0:40:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My love, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.42,0:40:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Write to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.63,0:40:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting married within the month,\Nwith or without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.83,0:41:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta had shaken with fear\Nwaiting for that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, steady. Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.25,0:41:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.42,0:42:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Boy or girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.25,0:42:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know,\Nbut we're expecting two, not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.79,0:42:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know that though?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.88,0:42:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The same way I knew before Rebeca arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.75,0:42:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that she would soon step through\Nour front door with frightened eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.75,0:42:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm lying?\NAsk Mother. She'll tell you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.38,0:42:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Miguel!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.83,0:42:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.46,0:42:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-With Carlos. We're making this.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.63,0:42:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.50,0:42:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.17,0:42:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-I don't know. It feels funny.\N-What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.38,0:43:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.38,0:43:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilar!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.08,0:43:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.54,0:43:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a quick word?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.29,0:43:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, is Miguel in trouble?\N-No, no. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.33,0:43:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mind watching him for a moment?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.50,0:43:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.96,0:43:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, no, no, no! José! Uh… No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-No! Arcadio, no!\N-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.79,0:43:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,José, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.88,0:43:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no! No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act stupid. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.33,0:43:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody in town knows you're a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.75,0:44:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here. Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.67,0:44:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mm.\N-Not here! Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.54,0:44:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My son's outside.\NHe could hear us. Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.75,0:44:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, no! Arcadio!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.08,0:44:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.21,0:44:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.63,0:44:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return tonight. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.63,0:44:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave the door open\Nand the lights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.13,0:44:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah? You sure?\N-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.17,0:44:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd be the point\Nin lying to you, Arcadio?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.08,0:44:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.58,0:44:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Miguel! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.29,0:45:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He stayed up all night,\Nwaiting for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.75,0:45:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,listening to the agitated crickets\Nof the endless dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.08,0:45:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,growing more and more convinced\Nthat he had been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.83,0:46:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio realized that this was\Nnot the woman he was waiting for,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.88,0:46:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,because she did not smell of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.46,0:46:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a virgin,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.50,0:46:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and her name was Santa Sofía de la Piedad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.08,0:46:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilar Ternera had paid her fifty pesos,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.17,0:46:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,half of her life savings,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.79,0:46:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to do what she was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.42,0:46:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcadio had seen her many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but had never noticed her
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.42,0:47:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,because she had the rare virtue\Nof never existing completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.13,0:47:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,except at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.67,0:47:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But from that day on,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.38,0:47:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he huddled like a cat\Nin the warmth of her armpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.42,0:47:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"…blessed is the fruit of\Nthy womb, Jesus. Holy Mary, Mother of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.67,0:47:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,pray for us sinners."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.54,0:47:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lead not into temptation,\Nbut deliver us from evil."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.54,0:47:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hail Mary, full of grace,\Nthe Lord is with thee."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.54,0:47:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Blessed art thou amongst women,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.92,0:47:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and blessed is the fruit\Nof thy womb, Jesus."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.00,0:47:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.38,0:47:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.00,0:47:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Reme! Reme, breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.75,0:48:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.21,0:48:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.83,0:48:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.42,0:48:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.04,0:48:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe, Remedios! Breathe! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.88,0:48:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me! I'm right here!\NI'm right here, my love! My love?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.58,0:48:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My love, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.96,0:48:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Look at me. Don't go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.75,0:48:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go to sleep. Don't go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.00,0:48:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My love! Don't go to sleep, my darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.21,0:48:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.79,0:48:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Remedios died,\Npoisoned by an infection in her blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.13,0:48:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,with a set of twins in her womb.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.75,0:49:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, more than ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.13,0:49:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,given the terrible circumstances\Nthat bring us together…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.33,0:49:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I give thanks to God
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.63,0:49:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for His infinite wisdom and love…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.50,0:49:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,for He has opened for us, just in time…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,…the doors of His temple, of His house,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.29,0:49:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can leave
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.00,0:50:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,pain
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.71,0:50:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and the weight of this tragedy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.17,0:50:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amaranta had begged\Nwith such fervor
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for something horrible to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.00,0:50:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so that she would not\Nhave to poison Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.29,0:50:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She felt guilty for the death of Remedios
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.46,0:50:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and adopted Aureliano José\Nas the son that would keep her company
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.75,0:50:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,in her eternal solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.13,0:52:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Úrsula ordered\Na mourning period
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.04,0:52:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,of closed doors and windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.63,0:52:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And she forbade talking aloud\Nfor an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.46,0:54:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When the mourning\Nhad gone on long enough
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.83,0:54:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,for the cross-stitching sessions\Nto resume,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.96,0:54:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a gush of wind blew the doors open\Nat 2:00 in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.79,0:55:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.46,0:55:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It was José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.92,0:55:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He had returned as poor as he had left,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.63,0:55:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and even his father,\Nunder the solitary of the chestnut tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.92,0:55:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,had an impression that an earthquake\Nwas tearing the house apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.71,0:55:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,BASED ON THE NOVEL\NBY GABRIEL GARCÍA MÁRQUEZ
